Typhoon ASR Realtime (speech recognition model)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model: typhoon-ai/typhoon-asr-realtime, https://huggingface.co/typhoon-ai/typhoon-asr-realtime
Authors: the Typhoon team at SCB 10X (Warit Sirichotedumrong, Adisai Na-Thalang, Potsawee
Manakul, Pittawat Taveekitworachai, Sittipong Sripaisarnmongkol, Kunat Pipatanakul).
Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0),
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Changes: this project publishes an ONNX export of the model with 8-bit dynamic quantisation
(encoder, decoder and joiner exported separately, ONNX metadata added) for use with
sherpa-onnx. The export is produced by tools/export_typhoon_rt_onnx.py and published as the
GitHub Release "models-typhoon-rt-v1" together with an attribution README. No retraining was
done. This export is not made or endorsed by SCB 10X or the Typhoon team. Use of the model is
also subject to the OpenTyphoon terms: https://opentyphoon.ai/tac
Citation: Sirichotedumrong et al., "Typhoon ASR Real-time: FastConformer-Transducer for Thai
Automatic Speech Recognition", arXiv:2601.13044 (2026).

