------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Live2D
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains no Live2D Cubism Core, no Cubism SDK and no Live2D model files.
VTube Studio renders the avatar as a separate application that the streamer installs. Live2D
sample models (for example the "Mao" model used in configuration examples) are provided by
Live2D Inc. under the Live2D Free Material License Agreement and the sample model terms of use;
check those terms, including the limits on commercial use, before streaming with them:
https://www.live2d.com/eula/live2d-free-material-license-agreement_en.html
https://www.live2d.com/eula/live2d-sample-model-terms_en.html
A future browser renderer (M6) requires the user to download Cubism Core from Live2D directly.

