Neuro Game SDK compatibility
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The M4 game server is compatible with the Neuro Game SDK protocol
(https://github.com/VedalAI/neuro-sdk). This project is independent: it is not affiliated with,
endorsed by or connected to Vedal, VedalAI or the Neuro-sama project, and "Neuro-sama" is used
only to describe the protocol and the design inspiration.

